# flow, async, dep and an external node, and no key (FIXPLAN F2)
...@mini-theme
direction: down
web: Web app {class: actor}
orders: Orders {class: service}
notify: Notifier {class: service}
stripe: Stripe {class: [service; external]}
web -> orders: places {class: flow}
orders -> notify: publishes {class: async}
orders -> stripe: charges {class: dep}
